{{define "bus"}}
<section class="space-y-10 pb-12" id="bus-demo-page" data-bus-page data-enabled="{{.CanUseBus}}">
    <header class="space-y-5">
        <a
            class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary transition hover:text-primary/80 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring"
            href="/"
            >← 返回首页</a
        >
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-muted-foreground uppercase">
                Message Bus · Live Demo
            </p>
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Bus 消息总线演示</h1>
            <p class="max-w-3xl text-base/8 text-muted-foreground">
                两个可操作的消息链路：REST + WebSocket 实现固定 topic 广播；REST + SSE + WebSocket
                完成设备查询与逐条回执。切换 Tab 可直接体验两种用法。 当前应用使用 Redis Bus；共享
                Redis 命名空间的 Web 实例可跨进程投递。
            </p>
        </div>
    </header>

    {{if .Message}}
    <p
        role="alert"
        class="rounded-xl border border-destructive/30 bg-destructive/10 p-4 text-sm text-destructive"
    >
        {{.Message}}
    </p>
    {{end}} {{if not .CanUseBus}}
    <div class="rounded-xl border bg-muted/40 p-5 text-sm/7">
        <p>登录后可连接 WebSocket、发布广播与提交查询。</p>
        <a
            href="/admin/login?returnTo=%2Ftest%2Fbus"
            class="font-medium text-primary underline underline-offset-4"
            >前往登录</a
        >
    </div>
    {{end}}
    <dialog
        data-bus-login-dialog
        aria-labelledby="bus-login-title"
        aria-describedby="bus-login-description"
        class="fixed inset-0 m-auto max-h-[calc(100%_-_3rem)] w-[calc(100%_-_3rem)] max-w-md overflow-y-auto rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 text-card-foreground shadow-xl backdrop:bg-black/50"
    >
        <h2 id="bus-login-title" class="text-lg font-semibold">请先登录</h2>
        <p id="bus-login-description" class="mt-3 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
            登录后即可连接 WebSocket。登录成功后将返回 Bus 演示页，继续体验消息收发。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-end gap-3">
            <button
                data-bus-login-cancel
                type="button"
                class="inline-flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-input bg-background px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition hover:bg-accent focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring"
            >
                取消
            </button>
            <a
                href="/admin/login?returnTo=%2Ftest%2Fbus"
                autofocus
                class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground transition hover:bg-primary/90 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring"
            >
                去登录
            </a>
        </div>
    </dialog>
    <noscript
        ><p class="rounded-xl border bg-muted/40 p-4 text-sm">
            开启 JavaScript 可操作广播、设备模拟器与 SSE 查询。下方链路说明由 Go 服务端直接渲染。
        </p></noscript
    >
    <div class="border-b" role="tablist" aria-label="Bus 演示场景">
        <button
            id="broadcast-tab"
            data-bus-tab="broadcast"
            type="button"
            role="tab"
            aria-controls="broadcast-panel"
            aria-selected="true"
            class="min-h-12 cursor-pointer border-b-2 border-transparent px-5 text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground transition hover:text-foreground focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring aria-selected:border-primary aria-selected:text-primary"
        >
            01 · REST + WebSocket
        </button>
        <button
            id="bus-query-tab"
            data-bus-tab="query"
            type="button"
            role="tab"
            aria-controls="bus-query-scene"
            aria-selected="false"
            tabindex="-1"
            class="min-h-12 cursor-pointer border-b-2 border-transparent px-5 text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground transition hover:text-foreground focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring aria-selected:border-primary aria-selected:text-primary"
        >
            02 · REST + SSE + WebSocket
        </button>
    </div>

    <section
        id="broadcast-panel"
        data-bus-panel="broadcast"
        role="tabpanel"
        aria-labelledby="broadcast-tab"
        tabindex="0"
    >
        <section aria-labelledby="broadcast-heading" class="space-y-5" id="bus-broadcast-workbench">
            <div class="space-y-2">
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-primary uppercase">
                    01 · REST + WebSocket · 一对多广播
                </p>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight" id="broadcast-heading">
                    发布消息，实时接收
                </h2>
                <p class="max-w-3xl text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
                    REST 发布到固定 topic
                    <code class="break-all text-foreground">demo:bus:broadcast</code>；连接
                    <code class="break-all text-foreground">/api/websocket/bus-broadcast</code>
                    的标签页都会收到
                    <code>bus.broadcast.message</code>。可以打开两个标签页观察广播。
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid items-start gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2">
                <div class="rounded-xl border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6">
                    <div class="contents space-y-5">
                        <div class="space-y-3">
                            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">订阅连接</h3>
                            <p
                                aria-live="polite"
                                class="text-sm text-muted-foreground"
                                id="broadcast-status"
                                data-broadcast-status
                                role="status"
                            >
                                尚未连接。
                            </p>
                            <button
                                class="inline-flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-input bg-background px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground transition hover:bg-accent focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring"
                                id="broadcast-toggle"
                                data-broadcast-connect
                                type="button"
                            >
                                连接 Bus WebSocket
                            </button>
                        </div>
                        <form
                            class="space-y-3 border-t pt-5"
                            id="broadcast-form"
                            data-broadcast-form
                        >
                            <label class="block text-sm font-medium" for="bus-message"
                                >发布内容</label
                            >
                            <input
                                class="min-h-11 w-full rounded-lg border border-input bg-background px-3 text-base text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50"
                                id="bus-message"
                                {{if not .CanUseBus}}disabled{{end}}
                                maxlength="2000"
                                required
                                value="本地 Bus 测试"
                            />
                            <button
                                class="inline-flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground transition hover:bg-primary/90 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50"
                                id="broadcast-publish"
                                {{if not .CanUseBus}}disabled{{end}}
                                type="submit"
                            >
                                发布到 Bus
                            </button>
                            <p
                                class="text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground"
                                id="broadcast-publish-result"
                                data-broadcast-feedback
                                role="status"
                                aria-live="polite"
                            >
                                发布操作沿用登录会话；发布确认表示 Redis Bus 已接收消息。
                            </p>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
                        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">WebSocket 接收记录</h3>
                        <button
                            aria-controls="broadcast-history"
                            class="min-h-11 cursor-pointer px-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary hover:text-primary/80 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50"
                            disabled
                            id="broadcast-clear"
                            data-broadcast-clear
                            aria-label="清空广播记录"
                            type="button"
                        >
                            清空记录
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <p
                        class="mt-3 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground"
                        id="broadcast-empty"
                        data-log-empty
                    >
                        连接后，发布消息即可在这里查看每条事件。
                    </p>
                    <ol
                        aria-label="广播接收记录"
                        aria-live="polite"
                        class="mt-4 max-h-96 min-w-0 space-y-3 overflow-y-auto"
                        id="broadcast-history"
                        data-broadcast-log
                    ></ol>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section
            class="mt-8 space-y-5 border-t pt-8"
            id="broadcast-topic-flow"
            aria-labelledby="broadcast-topic-heading"
        >
            <div class="space-y-2">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold" id="broadcast-topic-heading">Topic 与消息流向</h2>
                <p class="text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
                    REST 负责发布，WebSocket 负责接收。打开多个标签页可观察同一条消息的广播效果。
                </p>
            </div>
            <ol class="grid gap-3 text-sm/6 sm:grid-cols-3">
                <li class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border bg-card p-4">
                    <span class="font-semibold text-primary">01 · REST 发布</span>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
                        演示页面向
                        <code class="break-all text-foreground">POST /api/rest/bus/broadcast</code>
                        提交消息。
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border bg-card p-4">
                    <span class="font-semibold text-primary">02 · Bus 投递</span>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
                        服务端发布到固定 topic
                        <code class="break-all text-foreground">demo:bus:broadcast</code>。
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border bg-card p-4">
                    <span class="font-semibold text-primary">03 · WebSocket 接收</span>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
                        连接
                        <code class="break-all text-foreground">/api/websocket/bus-broadcast</code>
                        的订阅者收到 <code>bus.broadcast.message</code>。
                    </p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </section>
    </section>

    <section
        class="space-y-5"
        id="bus-query-scene"
        data-bus-panel="query"
        role="tabpanel"
        aria-labelledby="bus-query-tab"
        tabindex="0"
    >
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-primary uppercase">
                02 · REST + SSE + WebSocket · 请求与回执
            </p>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight" id="bus-query-scene-heading">
                设备查询，逐条返回结果
            </h2>
            <p class="max-w-3xl text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
                连接一个浏览器设备模拟器后提交查询。命令经 Bus 和 WebSocket
                送达设备；设备回执经独立的结果 topic 路由，再由本次 POST 的 SSE 响应返回。
                每次成功查询随机回复 1–3 条结果，每条发送前等待 200–700
                毫秒；回执模式支持成功、错误与超时，服务端查询期限为 5 秒。
            </p>
        </div>
        <section id="bus-query-workbench">
            <div class="grid items-start gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
                <section
                    class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 text-card-foreground shadow-sm"
                    aria-labelledby="device-heading"
                >
                    <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.3em] text-muted-foreground uppercase">
                        device
                    </p>
                    <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold" id="device-heading">
                        设备连接（Websocket）
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
                        当前演示使用一个浏览器设备模拟器；连接就绪后将自动接收并执行查询。
                    </p>

                    <div class="contents">
                        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4">
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                                连接状态：
                                <span
                                    class="ml-1 inline-block rounded-lg border bg-muted/40 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-foreground"
                                    id="device-status"
                                    data-device-status
                                    role="status"
                                    aria-live="polite"
                                    >未连接</span
                                >
                            </p>
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
                                <button
                                    id="device-toggle"
                                    data-device-connect
                                    type="button"
                                    class="inline-flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground transition hover:bg-primary/90 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50"
                                >
                                    连接设备</button
                                ><label
                                    class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground"
                                    for="device-mode"
                                    >回执模式<select
                                        id="device-mode"
                                        data-device-mode
                                        {{if not .CanUseBus}}disabled{{end}}
                                        class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border border-input bg-background px-3 text-sm text-foreground focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-ring"
                                    >
                                        <option value="success">成功</option>
                                        <option value="error">错误</option>
                                        <option value="timeout">超时</option>
                                    </select></label
                                >
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-8 border-t pt-6">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">设备记录</h3>
                            <button
                                id="clear-device-history"
                                data-device-clear
                                type="button"
                                aria-label="清空设备记录"
                                aria-controls="device-history"
                                disabled
                                class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium text-primary hover:text-primary/80 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50"
                            >
                                清空记录
                            </button>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground" data-log-empty>
                            尚无设备消息。连接后等待查询。
                        </p>
                        <ol
                            class="mt-4 max-h-96 min-w-0 space-y-3 overflow-y-auto"
                            id="device-history"
                            data-device-log
                            aria-label="设备记录"
                            aria-live="polite"
                            aria-relevant="additions text"
                        ></ol>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section
                    class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 text-card-foreground shadow-sm"
                    aria-labelledby="query-heading"
                >
                    <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.3em] text-muted-foreground uppercase">
                        request
                    </p>
                    <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold" id="query-heading">
                        用户查询（REST + SSE）
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
                        输入查询后，每笔请求在下方单独显示接收状态和设备执行结果。
                    </p>

                    <fieldset {{if not .CanUseBus}}disabled{{end}} class="contents disabled:opacity-60">
                        <form class="mt-6 space-y-4" id="query-form" data-query-form>
                            <div class="space-y-2">
                                <label class="block text-sm font-medium" for="bus-query-content"
                                    >查询内容</label
                                >
                                <textarea
                                    id="bus-query-content"
                                    maxlength="2000"
                                    required
                                    rows="3"
                                    class="min-h-28 w-full resize-y rounded-lg border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 text-base text-foreground transition outline-none placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50"
                                    placeholder="例如：查询设备状态"
                                ></textarea>
                                <p data-query-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite" class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                                    最多 2000 字；回执模式支持成功、错误与超时。
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <button
                                id="query-submit"
                                data-query-submit
                                type="submit"
                                class="inline-flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground transition hover:bg-primary/90 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50"
                            >
                                发送查询
                            </button>
                        </form>
                    </fieldset>

                    <div class="mt-8 border-t pt-6">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">查询记录</h3>
                            <button
                                id="clear-query-history"
                                data-query-clear
                                type="button"
                                aria-label="清空并取消查询"
                                title="清空记录并取消正在进行的查询"
                                aria-controls="query-history"
                                disabled
                                class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium text-primary hover:text-primary/80 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50"
                            >
                                清空记录
                            </button>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground" data-log-empty>
                            尚无查询。提交后可在这里查看结果。
                        </p>
                        <ol
                            class="mt-4 max-h-96 min-w-0 space-y-3 overflow-y-auto"
                            id="query-history"
                            data-query-log
                            aria-label="查询记录"
                            aria-live="polite"
                            aria-relevant="additions text"
                        ></ol>
                    </div>
                </section>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section
            class="space-y-5 border-t pt-8"
            id="query-topic-flow"
            aria-labelledby="query-topic-heading"
        >
            <div class="space-y-2">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold" id="query-topic-heading">Topic 与消息流向</h2>
                <p class="text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
                    同一次 POST 建立 SSE 结果流；命令和回执分别使用固定与请求专属的 Bus topic。
                </p>
            </div>
            <ol class="grid gap-3 text-sm/6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
                <li class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border bg-card p-4">
                    <span class="font-semibold text-primary">01 · 订阅结果</span>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
                        <code class="break-all text-foreground">POST /api/rest/bus/query</code>
                        先订阅本次查询专属 topic。
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border bg-card p-4">
                    <span class="font-semibold text-primary">02 · 发送命令</span>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
                        Bus 发布 <code>bus.query.execute</code>，设备通过 WebSocket 接收命令。
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border bg-card p-4">
                    <span class="font-semibold text-primary">03 · 路由回执</span>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
                        设备通过 WebSocket 回传 <code>bus.query.result</code> 或
                        <code>bus.query.error</code>，服务端按请求路由。
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border bg-card p-4">
                    <span class="font-semibold text-primary">04 · SSE 返回</span>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
                        本次 POST 的 SSE 响应逐条发送 <code>result</code> 或
                        <code>error</code>，最后以 <code>done</code> 结束。
                    </p>
                </li>
            </ol>
            <dl class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <div class="min-w-0 space-y-2 rounded-xl border bg-card p-5">
                    <dt class="font-semibold">查询命令 · 固定 topic</dt>
                    <dd class="space-y-2 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
                        <code class="block break-all text-foreground">demo:bus:query:requests</code>
                        <p>查询服务发布命令，设备 WebSocket 订阅此 topic。</p>
                    </dd>
                </div>
                <div class="min-w-0 space-y-2 rounded-xl border bg-card p-5">
                    <dt class="font-semibold">设备回执 · 每次查询独立的 topic</dt>
                    <dd class="space-y-2 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
                        <code class="block break-all text-foreground"
                            >demo:bus:query:results:&#123;responseKey&#125;</code
                        >
                        <p>服务端先订阅，再发布命令；设备结果只返回对应的 SSE 请求。</p>
                    </dd>
                </div>
            </dl>
            <p class="text-xs/6 text-muted-foreground">
                <code>requestId</code> 标识用户查询；服务端生成的 <code>responseKey</code>
                隔离本次 Bus 回执，避免不同查询串流。
            </p>
        </section>
    </section>
    {{if .CanUseBus}}
    <p class="text-xs/6 text-muted-foreground">
        当前账号：{{.UserName}} · 操作沿用登录会话和同源校验。
    </p>
    {{end}}
</section>
{{end}}
